{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_01",
  "title": "闲聊波尔卡",
  "storyCode": "LE-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d8284b100eb94add0024b77cc2f35a3e6d6b2b0856e7e2e1693f959a29b99ce6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "虽然我在选拔赛上让你们两个出局了，但现在情况有变，你们是《晨暮》的第一候选了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "情况有变是说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "原定要演奏《晨暮》的那两个人不能参加音乐会了，所以我才找你们过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不能参加音乐会......他们出什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "那两个人昨天下午跑到酒馆大吃大喝去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "本来这倒也正常，可是，不知为了什么鸡毛蒜皮的小事，这两个活宝竟然在酒馆里和人打了起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "结果，吹长笛的胳膊骨折，拉大提琴的更厉害，居然摔断了尾椎骨，坐都坐不下去，还趴在床上说自己可以站着拉琴，简直胡闹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "你好像很惊讶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "这实在有些......出人意料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "出人意料？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "说实话，入选的第二天就出这种事，假如这不仅仅是一场偶然的打架斗殴，你就是最大的嫌疑人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我就是最大的嫌疑人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不——不不不，这事和我毫无瓜葛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我还是更希望用音乐打动您，而不是对无辜之人拳打脚踢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "说得倒挺好听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "不过，既然你有钱资助白垩，花钱雇几个人，对你而言应该也轻而易举，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "车尔尼先生，我也可以作证，黑键没有做这种事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "你能作证？你昨天一直盯着他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "——是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "你盯着他干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "当然不是“他盯着我”，而是我们俩在一起，商量如何让您回心转意啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "虽然直到最后也没商量出什么结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "白垩，他说的是真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "（摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "既然这样，那我姑且相信白垩一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "谢谢车尔尼先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "别急着高兴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "说到底，你们是替补上来的，离我的要求还有不小的差距。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "尤其是黑键，你是拖后腿的那个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我给你们一天时间练习，晚上再到我家来，我来验收。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "只有达到我的最低标准，你们才算是入选了。要不然，我宁可把《晨暮》这首曲子撤掉，明白吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "明白，请您放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "还有，白垩，你不是没有大提琴吗？这把琴你先拿回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我......我真的可以拿吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "当然可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "如果今晚你们能达到我的要求，这把琴就是你的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "——谢谢，谢谢您！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "好了，回去吧，我也要整理一下自己的思路——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "是乌尔苏拉吗？你又忘记带钥匙了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "门外的声音",
      "text": "车尔尼先生，我是罗德岛的干员，您可以叫我芙蓉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "是芙蓉！难道爷爷出了什么状况——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "您好，车尔尼先生，初次见面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "你好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我和他们已经聊完了，你要是有事就带他们走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "芙蓉，爷爷的病情有什么变化吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "放心，放心。你爷爷经过治疗之后，情况已经比较稳定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "车尔尼先生，其实我不是来找白垩，而是来找您的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "找我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我希望能了解一下您最近的病情变化，不知道您现在方不方便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "问我这个干嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "最近夕照区出现了不少异常好转的感染者，我来夕照区就是为了调查这一现象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "另外，您在夕照区家喻户晓，没准您对整体情况也有一些把握。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "不好意思，我自己一直好得很，至于别人的病情，我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "可您不是要开告别音乐会吗？一般来说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "不好意思，我需要一个安静的环境，现在能请你离开了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "又是哪位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "门外的声音",
      "text": "先生，开开门，咱忘记带钥匙啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "白垩，能不能麻烦你再去开个门？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "老奶奶，您拎了好多东西啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好孩子，快去屋里坐着，咱自己就能拿得动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "没关系的，我来帮您把东西送到厨房！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "这位是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "乌尔苏拉，我的远房亲戚。我一直受她照顾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "家里来了这么多客人，这可不多见......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "这位怕不是贵族老爷？这可真是失礼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不敢当。您要是愿意，可以直接叫我黑键。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "您这样的贵族，就别和咱老婆子开玩笑啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "这可不是玩笑，您叫我黑键就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "当然是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "那就请您恕咱无礼啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "乌尔苏拉婆婆，您好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "欸，怎么是萨卡——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "呸，呸！姑娘，咱只是嘴快，没别的意思，别往心里去啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "没事的，乌尔苏拉婆婆，我已经习惯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "不管怎么说，咱还是得给你道个歉......对不住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "来找先生有什么事啊？也是音乐会的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那倒不是。我来是想问一下，车尔尼先生的病情有没有什么变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "你是医生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我是罗德岛的干员，您可以叫我芙蓉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "那你和行板是同事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "行板是本地干员，我是从本舰来维谢海姆出差的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "那咱就放心啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "先生和咱的药都是行板给配的，夕照区有不少人都从罗德岛拿药呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "先生这几天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "先生，人家毕竟是医生，医生关心你的身体，这是好事呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我又没请她来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "这就不对了，你不请她，她也进不来呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "从去年开始，先生的身体就一直不怎么好，一直到今年初春都是这样，要不然，也不会想着办什么告别音乐会了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "可是从昨天开始，先生看起来反而好了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "还有其他情况吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "让咱想想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "乌尔苏拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "好好，咱不说啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "非常感谢您的协助，乌尔苏拉婆婆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "如果车尔尼先生有什么情况，还请您告诉我一声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "就算没有这句话，要是出了什么事，咱也得去拜托你们罗德岛呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "聊完了？高兴了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "聊完啦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔苏拉",
      "text": "——呀，瞧咱这记性，说着要做土豆汤，却忘了买土豆......咱再去一趟市场！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "车尔尼先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "（几乎冒出火来的眼神）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "——乌尔苏拉婆婆，我也和您一起去市场！我想向您请教一些烹饪上的问题！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那，既然大家都走了，我们也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "车尔尼先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "......钥匙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "乌尔苏拉婆婆，钥匙，您的钥匙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "呼、呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "真没想到一个老太太也能走这么快，我差点追不上......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "刚才多亏有你帮我打圆场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "没什么，我相信你不会为了入选做那种事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "现在钥匙也送过去了，我们也该在夕照区找个地方练习了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "不能像大家一样，直接在街上演奏吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我们是练习，又不是卖艺，街上太嘈杂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你家怎么样？正巧你爷爷也搬出去了，我每天从高庭区走过来也累得要死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "能不能拜托你给我腾一张床，我这段时间就住你家里了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我倒是很欢迎，可我家太破，我怕你住不习惯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "会习惯的，会习惯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "这里就是我家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "怎么了吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "（房间太小，窗户漏风，木料发霉，隔音几乎等于没有......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "没什么，挺好的，挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "——等下，这里只有一张单人床。你爷爷睡哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "爷爷睡床，我打地铺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "可......这不就是一张地毯吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "地毯也挺好的，我也已经睡习惯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "如果你要在这儿住，我就接着打地铺，没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "还是先练习吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不行，我在波音这里卡住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "没事，我们从上一行最后一个小节重新开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "又是这个波音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我在这一段放慢一点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不用，一个装饰音而已。我就是有点犹豫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "——又是这儿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "黑键，我把速度放慢，别再纠结这个装饰音了，用单音带过去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "标记就写在谱上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "可是为了给这个波音做准备，你连前面一段的气息都不稳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "太好了，完整地合了一遍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "可那个装饰音我没吹，车尔尼肯定听得出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "没关系的，我们还有时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "话是这么说，可按照现在这个状态，你已经用不着接着练了，只有我还得继续花时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "哪有，我其实也有处理不好的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "你看这里，其实是有强弱对比的，我刚刚没表现出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......还真是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "还有一些地方我处理得也很勉强，要说熟悉还早呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......可吓了我一跳，我还以为你已经彻底练熟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "哈哈，时间这么短，想一次性练熟也不太可能，很多东西是要慢慢来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你说得对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "先休息一会儿吧，之后我们再去抠细节。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "越过高高的山岗，恶魔踏入黄昏的中央。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "血中的恶疾隐伏，款款招来蔓延的死亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "虫自阴暗中涌出，肆意喷吐毁灭的前奏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "终曲的合奏消散，灾祸带走最后的阳光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "这样的改法，您意下如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "和之前的版本也差不多。你确信这个预言能赶走罗德岛的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "光是预言可能不够，但要是加上陛下的名号，再以此为由头引发一点小小的骚动......成功的可能性就会很大，不成功也没什么坏处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "能确保预言流传的范围局限在夕照区内部吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "请您放心，之前小规模散布的预言并没有扩散的迹象；再者，作为感染者聚居区——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那就去做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
